{"product_id":"drift-smart-watch","title":"Drift Smart Watch","description":"\u003cp\u003eConquer every challenge with Drift Smart Watch: A Luxury Sport marvel with a 1.91\" Curved HD Display. Elevate your game with unmatched style and functionality!!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDrift Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmp up your lifestyle with the Drift Smartwatch, where technology meets style. Make your routine more efficient and stylish with a smartwatch designed to keep up with your life. Order your Drift Smartwatch today and experience the perfect blend of innovation and design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis smartwatch is your ideal partner for staying connected, monitoring your health, and enhancing your daily activities. Whether you're at work, working out, or socializing, the Flex Smartwatch fits seamlessly into your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Drift Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Drift Smartwatch is packed with features to help you stay ahead. Monitor your fitness with its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multiple sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media updates, all accessible on a vibrant, high-resolution display. Its long-lasting battery ensures you're always ready for action, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily match your watch to your style and needs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Flex Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 400 x 400 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 46 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Drift SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Drift Smartwatch means opting for a device that enhances your life with its superior functionality and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and customizable appearance make it a standout choice in the smartwatch market. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures a smooth experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Orange","offer_id":46640271950102,"sku":"19807","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red","offer_id":46640272015638,"sku":"19808","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":46640271819030,"sku":"19809","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Gold","offer_id":46640271884566,"sku":"19806","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Gold","offer_id":46640271917334,"sku":"19805","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":46640271786262,"sku":"19804","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":46640271753494,"sku":"19810","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/DRIFT_G_black.png?v=1717759123","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/drift-smart-watch","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}